<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken finalises takeover of Stadshypotek.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken finalises takeover of Stadshypotek.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken said on Monday it had secured over 98 percent of shares of Stadshypotek, securing its takeover of the mortgage bank.</p>
</text>
